# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
debug
target

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these, which store debugging information
*.pdb

# Generated by cargo mutants
# Contains mutation testing data
**/mutants.out*/

# RustRover
#  JetBrains specific template is maintained in a separate JetBrains.gitignore that can
#  be found at https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Global/JetBrains.gitignore
#  and can be added to the global gitignore or merged into this file.  For a more nuclear
#  option (not recommended) you can uncomment the following to ignore the entire idea folder.
#.idea/

**/CLAUDE.md
**/*.claude
**/*.lock
# …except the Cargo lockfile: binaries commit it (Cargo's guidance), so a dependency regression
# can only arrive as a reviewable `cargo update` commit — never ambush a CI run — and the RustSec
# audit scans the exact resolution every build uses.
!Cargo.lock
config/settings.yaml
.fmp_cache/
.folioman_turnover_*.txt
.folioman_net_stamp
.sec_cache

# screen run-to-run gate state (EXIT-review footer)
.screen_state.json

# alert run-to-run market entry state (flip-ping dedup)
.alert_state

# alert per-ticker dip dedup (tickers already pinged; recovery clears)
.alert_dips

# ranked-snapshot journal (one line per screen day; `track` grades it)
.screen_snapshots.jsonl

# wide-backtest method verdict (written by `backtest universe`; the screen footer cites it)
.backtest_verdict.json

# Trading212 tradable-instrument list (weekly cache; order-glue symbol resolution)
.t212_instruments.json

# persistent ISIN -> Yahoo-symbol resolutions (positive-only; stabilizes the ETF universe)
.isin_cache.json
# last-good venue ISIN lists (fallback across venue outages)
.venue_isins.json
# weekly ESMA+FCA FIRDS ETF-ISIN scan (regulatory universe source)
.regulatory_isins.json
# definitive Yahoo "no such ISIN" answers for regulatory-sourced ISINs (30-day TTL)
.isin_negative_cache.json
# weekly Yahoo quoteSummary TER/AUM for funds missing BF facts
.fund_facts_cache.json
# tickers whose MAX-monthly history added no bars beyond the daily window (30-day TTL)
.long_history_skip.json
.long_history_cache.json
.holdings_cache.json
.screen_alerts.log
